Parity notes:
  - Data sources reproduced: useVehicles + useClimateLatest (single ClimateSnapshot, 5s poll), useUnits
    (temperature unit), useTranslation('dashboard') -> ClimateStatusStrings facade. No HTTP in the view;
    everything flows through the P1/S8 ClimateStatusSource seam.
  - Web branches reproduced verbatim:
      Cabin   = inside_temp != null  ? fmtInt(convertTempFromSI(inside_temp))  + tempUnit : '—'
      Outside = outside_temp != null ? fmtInt(convertTempFromSI(outside_temp)) + tempUnit : '—'
      HVAC    = hvac_power != null   ? `${fmtNumber(hvac_power, 1)} kW`                    : '—'
               (NOTE: the status widget guards only `!= null`, so 0 kW still shows — unlike the
                ClimateControlPanel's `hvac_power > 0` rule. Covered by a dedicated adapter test.)
      Defrost chip when defrost_mode && defrost_mode !== 'Off' (Snowflake / blue).
      Heater  chip when battery_heater_on truthy (Zap / orange).
      Empty state "No climate data" with a thermometer glyph when the row resolves absent.
  - All 7 source i18n keys present (widget.climate, widget.cabin, widget.outside, widget.hvac,
    widget.defrost, widget.batHeater, widget.noClimate) + the kW unit suffix + native chrome keys
    (description, live/stale/offline, refresh/retry/loading/errorTitle, stale/offline banners).
  - SI cutover honored: on-disk/API stays SI Celsius (Phase-42); convertTempFromSI is applied only at the
    render boundary (ClimateStatusTempConvert.fromSI), never on disk. HVAC power passed through in kW as
    the web source does (`hvac_power` is the kW compat alias the web widget reads).
  - States rendered: loading (skeleton chrome), empty (friendly), error (retry affordance), stale
    (chip + banner), offline (chip + banner), content. Telemetry view.opened surface="ClimateStatusWidget"
    emitted once on first start (P1/S11).
  - Apple-idiomatic mapping: lucide -> SF Symbols (thermometer.medium, snowflake, bolt.fill, power-less);
    recharts/leaflet -> none (this surface has no chart/map); VoiceOver labels on every interactive element
    + per-row/-chip combined labels; Dynamic Type + Reduce Motion inherited from the shared tokens/skeleton.
  - Type names prefixed `ClimateStatus*` to avoid collision with sibling ClimateControlPanelWidget's
    `ClimatePanel*` symbols in the single app module (verified: 0 collisions).

